{"vid":"xLTr5g_JT-4","source":"xLTr5g_JT-4.en-orig.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":6.4,"txt":"Like every great story, today's starts"},{"t":8.2,"txt":"out in Harbor Freight. These ammo boxes"},{"t":10.4,"txt":"catch my eye every time I'm there, and"},{"t":12.3,"txt":"I've been wanting to build a stove"},{"t":14,"txt":"that's wood-burning that'll fit in here."},{"t":16,"txt":"And I know I'm not the first person to"},{"t":17.3,"txt":"build a wood stove in an ammo box, but I"},{"t":19.4,"txt":"want a full rocket stove that doesn't"},{"t":21.2,"txt":"skimp on performance. So, I've been"},{"t":22.8,"txt":"messing around in the CAD system. I"},{"t":24.2,"txt":"think I have a design that'll work. I'm"},{"t":26.3,"txt":"going to order the parts up from"},{"t":27.4,"txt":"SendCutSend, we'll put them together,"},{"t":29.2,"txt":"and see if this actually works. Well,"},{"t":31.6,"txt":"what have I done? I mean, the parts are"},{"t":33.2,"txt":"here, and somehow I've got to figure out"},{"t":35.2,"txt":"how all the stuff in here"},{"t":38.3,"txt":"is going to fit into here. Let's look at"},{"t":40.2,"txt":"what we got."},{"t":49.3,"txt":"Now that it's out of the box, it's not"},{"t":50.9,"txt":"so bad. We've got our bent pieces here,"},{"t":52.8,"txt":"we've got a few more flat pieces there."},{"t":54.4,"txt":"It's all nice and thick material, and"},{"t":57.6,"txt":"it's amazing how well this was packaged,"},{"t":59.4,"txt":"especially given that it's free"},{"t":60.6,"txt":"shipping. Now, if you see projects like"},{"t":62.6,"txt":"this, and you think, \"I don't know how"},{"t":63.9,"txt":"to work CAD, or this all looks too"},{"t":66.1,"txt":"complicated.\" It's really not. I have a"},{"t":69.1,"txt":"couple tutorials I did full start to"},{"t":71.1,"txt":"finish on how to design and order your"},{"t":72.8,"txt":"own parts like this. You can check those"},{"t":74.3,"txt":"out linked in the description, as well"},{"t":75.9,"txt":"as a 15% off discount code to"},{"t":77.8,"txt":"SendCutSend. Let me show you how this"},{"t":79.7,"txt":"folding mechanism's going to work to fit"},{"t":81.5,"txt":"everything down in the box. So, this is"},{"t":83.2,"txt":"the side of the main inlet tube, and the"},{"t":86.8,"txt":"combustion'll happen here. And then this"},{"t":89.1,"txt":"is part of the chimney. So, there's"},{"t":90.6,"txt":"these two threaded holes, and I'm going"},{"t":92.2,"txt":"to put a socket head cap screw in each"},{"t":94,"txt":"to act as a pin, and that will sit right"},{"t":96.6,"txt":"here and ride in these slots. So, when"},{"t":99.2,"txt":"it's in use,"},{"t":100.8,"txt":"it'll sit down in that groove right"},{"t":102.9,"txt":"there, and keep everything locked in"},{"t":105.2,"txt":"vertically. And then when you want to"},{"t":106.2,"txt":"fold it up, you just slide that up, and"},{"t":109.2,"txt":"then rotate it around. Well, here's"},{"t":111.5,"txt":"where I made an error. I didn't leave"},{"t":114.5,"txt":"enough clearance for that pin as I"},{"t":116.4,"txt":"folded it up, and this kind of thing can"},{"t":118.6,"txt":"happen. I've designed a lot of parts,"},{"t":120.3,"txt":"and you know, just cuz I make internet"},{"t":122,"txt":"videos about this type of stuff doesn't"},{"t":123.8,"txt":"mean that I'm saying I do it perfectly"},{"t":125.3,"txt":"every time, and here's an example of"},{"t":127.1,"txt":"that. So, we need to grind a little bit"},{"t":128.2,"txt":"of clearance away right there."},{"t":143,"txt":"Well, now I can start to piece together"},{"t":144.7,"txt":"this main inlet tube and firebox, and"},{"t":147.4,"txt":"I'm just using a different piece to act"},{"t":149.8,"txt":"as a shim, so I have my whole joint open"},{"t":152.7,"txt":"to weld up."},{"t":161.4,"txt":"Let's talk a little bit about the design"},{"t":163,"txt":"here. I didn't use any tab and slot. I"},{"t":164.9,"txt":"didn't really need it. You saw how"},{"t":166.1,"txt":"easily I could tack that up, and this"},{"t":168,"txt":"bend right there uh just squares"},{"t":170.5,"txt":"everything up without having to use any"},{"t":172.1,"txt":"tooling, so it's uh pretty nice whenever"},{"t":174.2,"txt":"you can do that. Now, these little feet"},{"t":176.4,"txt":"right here are going to give a little"},{"t":178.2,"txt":"space off the bottom of the ammo box,"},{"t":180.8,"txt":"and I've got some clearance on either"},{"t":183.4,"txt":"side to put some of this fiberglass"},{"t":185.5,"txt":"insulation in I just got off the Amazon."},{"t":187.6,"txt":"So, my hope is that the outside of the"},{"t":190.2,"txt":"ammo box is cool while I use it."},{"t":194.9,"txt":"Now, before the top goes on, I have this"},{"t":196.7,"txt":"little throttle plate that's going to go"},{"t":198.2,"txt":"in here so I can control my airflow."},{"t":213.3,"txt":"Now, I'll tack up the folding chimney."},{"t":226.2,"txt":"The last piece I need to tack together"},{"t":228,"txt":"is this chute that will automatically"},{"t":229.6,"txt":"feed the the down into the firebox. It"},{"t":232.2,"txt":"was a little bit of a snug fit and I"},{"t":234.2,"txt":"think that's because there was just a"},{"t":235.4,"txt":"slight amount of spring back on it. So,"},{"t":237,"txt":"once that has the top welded on, it"},{"t":239.1,"txt":"should keep everything nice and"},{"t":240.4,"txt":"straight. Now, before I put the top on,"},{"t":242.8,"txt":"I need to install this little lid and"},{"t":245,"txt":"this is on here to prevent air from"},{"t":247.4,"txt":"being drawn in, at least too much air"},{"t":249.8,"txt":"from being drawn in where the wood feeds"},{"t":252.3,"txt":"cuz I want the majority of the air to"},{"t":253.8,"txt":"come in through the bottom and that's"},{"t":255.8,"txt":"going to give me a more efficient flame."},{"t":261.5,"txt":"If my wife watches this and sees me"},{"t":263.4,"txt":"welding this shirt, oh, I'm going to"},{"t":264.8,"txt":"hear about it. This is one of her"},{"t":265.7,"txt":"favorites."},{"t":272.3,"txt":"Well, now it's time to start welding"},{"t":273.7,"txt":"these parts out and the majority of the"},{"t":275.8,"txt":"welds here are outside corner joints."},{"t":278.6,"txt":"Notice I'm just running a straight"},{"t":280.3,"txt":"stringer all the way across. I'm not"},{"t":282.2,"txt":"using any kind of manipulation. This"},{"t":284.1,"txt":"allows me to turn my settings up a"},{"t":285.8,"txt":"little bit higher, which allows me to"},{"t":288.3,"txt":"move faster and put less heat into the"},{"t":290.4,"txt":"part. I just made a video about this"},{"t":292.3,"txt":"explaining how that works, but this puts"},{"t":294.6,"txt":"a lot less heat in than if you do a lot"},{"t":296.6,"txt":"of manipulation to like stack dimes."},{"t":299.5,"txt":"Also, you can get really good"},{"t":301.4,"txt":"penetration. That doesn't matter too"},{"t":302.8,"txt":"much here, but you can see how nice and"},{"t":305,"txt":"consistent that penetration was."},{"t":307.5,"txt":"On this part, there's a very small"},{"t":310,"txt":"amount of material next to the weld and"},{"t":311.5,"txt":"I don't want that to warp and distort."},{"t":313.9,"txt":"So, I'm just going to use these little"},{"t":315.8,"txt":"clamps. These are great at Harbor"},{"t":316.9,"txt":"Freight. Every time there's those 30%"},{"t":318.4,"txt":"off anything under 10 bucks uh coupons I"},{"t":320.8,"txt":"get another pair of these. But, I'll"},{"t":323.1,"txt":"just clamp some scrap aluminum plate"},{"t":325.1,"txt":"right there and that will absorb the"},{"t":327.3,"txt":"extra heat as I run my weld."},{"t":330.4,"txt":"Now, if you're just getting started with"},{"t":332.2,"txt":"welding and fabrication and you want to"},{"t":334.1,"txt":"learn faster, check out my online"},{"t":336.4,"txt":"courses. I keep them as affordable as"},{"t":338,"txt":"possible, 39 bucks for a course and I'll"},{"t":340.9,"txt":"walk you through step-by-step, a lot of"},{"t":342.7,"txt":"hands-on exercises so you can learn a"},{"t":344.8,"txt":"lot faster than you would just by"},{"t":346.6,"txt":"watching YouTube videos."},{"t":354.4,"txt":"I could leave these as welded, but I'll"},{"t":356.2,"txt":"just do a quick blend right here. It'll"},{"t":358.2,"txt":"only take a couple of minutes and leave"},{"t":360.1,"txt":"it nice and smooth."},{"t":367.6,"txt":"You could use a lot of different tools"},{"t":369.1,"txt":"to cut the hole in the ammo can. I like"},{"t":371.2,"txt":"these small pneumatic tools cuz they"},{"t":373.6,"txt":"just give a little better control."},{"t":384,"txt":"To hold the stove in place in the can, I"},{"t":386,"txt":"want to use some plug welds on the"},{"t":387.6,"txt":"bottom where those feet rest. And so,"},{"t":390,"txt":"I'm going to mark the locations and"},{"t":391.7,"txt":"drill a couple holes. And a plug weld"},{"t":393.5,"txt":"basically just fill in that hole and"},{"t":395.5,"txt":"weld the top surface to the bottom."},{"t":405.2,"txt":"So, I work better in a tidy shop, and"},{"t":407.6,"txt":"I've got my mid-project mess here. So,"},{"t":409.2,"txt":"I'm going to go ahead and clean that up,"},{"t":410.5,"txt":"and then I need one more piece to sit"},{"t":413.1,"txt":"down in here. And I'm going to use some"},{"t":414.4,"txt":"expanded metal. And this will just be a"},{"t":417.6,"txt":"small piece to keep the wood from"},{"t":419.4,"txt":"falling clear down to the bottom of the"},{"t":421.4,"txt":"firebox. So, I want to have really good"},{"t":424.1,"txt":"airflow from that bottom up through. So,"},{"t":427.7,"txt":"a small bent piece like this will do the"},{"t":430.9,"txt":"trick."},{"t":442.7,"txt":"These socket head cap screws are just"},{"t":444.3,"txt":"going to act as pins, and I don't want"},{"t":445.8,"txt":"them coming loose. So, I'm just going to"},{"t":446.9,"txt":"use some Miller Blue Loctite."},{"t":461.6,"txt":"I think simple is best in a lot of cases"},{"t":464.2,"txt":"and so I'm just using two cross pieces"},{"t":466.6,"txt":"right here for the pan holder on top. I"},{"t":469.6,"txt":"like how it's looking. I just need to"},{"t":471,"txt":"check and make sure it folds up okay"},{"t":473,"txt":"before I stuff this thing in the box."},{"t":487.6,"txt":"I lined the box with this fiberglass"},{"t":489.3,"txt":"insulation from Amazon. The cheapest"},{"t":491.2,"txt":"stuff I could get was an inch thick and"},{"t":493.2,"txt":"I stripped it down to be about half an"},{"t":495.2,"txt":"inch thick. Just kind of split it in"},{"t":496.6,"txt":"half. And I thought I was going to drop"},{"t":498.3,"txt":"this in but like most projects, there's"},{"t":500.7,"txt":"some step you don't expect to be a"},{"t":502.4,"txt":"challenge and this is like the first"},{"t":503.8,"txt":"time I changed a diaper is what it feels"},{"t":505.3,"txt":"like. I mean five kids later I kind of"},{"t":507,"txt":"have it down but not this. Um I"},{"t":509.8,"txt":"obviously did better in shop class than"},{"t":511.6,"txt":"home ec cuz it turned into an episode of"},{"t":514,"txt":"the three stooges here trying to get"},{"t":515.7,"txt":"this packed in and I'm not super pumped"},{"t":517.8,"txt":"about how it went. But in the end I got"},{"t":520.4,"txt":"it stuffed in there and I think it'll"},{"t":521.8,"txt":"work okay."},{"t":523.3,"txt":"So here are the plug welds on the"},{"t":525.1,"txt":"bottom. Those are the little feet just"},{"t":526.9,"txt":"coming through those holes I drilled in"},{"t":528.4,"txt":"the bottom and I'll do this just to hold"},{"t":530.3,"txt":"it in place. It doesn't need a lot of"},{"t":532,"txt":"strength. Just something to keep it to"},{"t":533.8,"txt":"still."},{"t":535,"txt":"And I know it's not ideal to just weld"},{"t":537,"txt":"to the paint but I wanted to leave as"},{"t":538.3,"txt":"much paint intact as I could but I mean"},{"t":540.7,"txt":"you can just smell that through the"},{"t":542.3,"txt":"screen if that smoke coming out. I uh I"},{"t":545.1,"txt":"wouldn't do more than just a couple of"},{"t":546.5,"txt":"tacks and probably wouldn't even uh"},{"t":548.4,"txt":"recommend that you do that."},{"t":714.6,"txt":"Mhm."}],"words":[{"t":6.4,"w":"Like"},{"t":6.56,"w":"every"},{"t":6.76,"w":"great"},{"t":7.04,"w":"story,"},{"t":7.4,"w":"today's"},{"t":7.84,"w":"starts"},{"t":8.16,"w":"out"},{"t":8.36,"w":"in"},{"t":8.48,"w":"Harbor"},{"t":8.76,"w":"Freight."},{"t":9.16,"w":"These"},{"t":9.4,"w":"ammo"},{"t":9.72,"w":"boxes"},{"t":10.36,"w":"catch"},{"t":10.68,"w":"my"},{"t":10.96,"w":"eye"},{"t":11.2,"w":"every"},{"t":11.52,"w":"time"},{"t":11.8,"w":"I'm"},{"t":11.92,"w":"there,"},{"t":12.16,"w":"and"},{"t":12.28,"w":"I've"},{"t":12.4,"w":"been"},{"t":12.56,"w":"wanting"},{"t":12.84,"w":"to"},{"t":12.92,"w":"build"},{"t":13.16,"w":"a"},{"t":13.24,"w":"stove"},{"t":14.04,"w":"that's"},{"t":14.36,"w":"wood-burning"},{"t":15.36,"w":"that'll"},{"t":15.56,"w":"fit"},{"t":15.8,"w":"in"},{"t":15.88,"w":"here."},{"t":16.04,"w":"And"},{"t":16.12,"w":"I"},{"t":16.16,"w":"know"},{"t":16.28,"w":"I'm"},{"t":16.4,"w":"not"},{"t":16.56,"w":"the"},{"t":16.64,"w":"first"},{"t":16.92,"w":"person"},{"t":17.2,"w":"to"},{"t":17.28,"w":"build"},{"t":17.48,"w":"a"},{"t":17.52,"w":"wood"},{"t":17.76,"w":"stove"},{"t":18.04,"w":"in"},{"t":18.16,"w":"an"},{"t":18.28,"w":"ammo"},{"t":18.52,"w":"box,"},{"t":19.24,"w":"but"},{"t":19.36,"w":"I"},{"t":19.4,"w":"want"},{"t":19.6,"w":"a"},{"t":19.64,"w":"full"},{"t":20,"w":"rocket"},{"t":20.44,"w":"stove"},{"t":20.76,"w":"that"},{"t":20.88,"w":"doesn't"},{"t":21.2,"w":"skimp"},{"t":21.48,"w":"on"},{"t":21.68,"w":"performance."},{"t":22.4,"w":"So,"},{"t":22.48,"w":"I've"},{"t":22.6,"w":"been"},{"t":22.76,"w":"messing"},{"t":23.04,"w":"around"},{"t":23.28,"w":"in"},{"t":23.36,"w":"the"},{"t":23.44,"w":"CAD"},{"t":23.76,"w":"system."},{"t":24.16,"w":"I"},{"t":24.24,"w":"think"},{"t":24.52,"w":"I"},{"t":24.56,"w":"have"},{"t":24.72,"w":"a"},{"t":24.76,"w":"design"},{"t":25.16,"w":"that'll"},{"t":25.4,"w":"work."},{"t":26.24,"w":"I'm"},{"t":26.32,"w":"going"},{"t":26.44,"w":"to"},{"t